From: local <local@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sm6350-sony-xperia-lena-pdx213: enable UFS

Wire the UFS host controller and PHY supplies. Rails match Sony's downstream
DTBO (vcc=L7E, vccq2=L12A, vdda-phy=L18A, vdda-pll=L22A) and Fairphone 4's
mainline override on the same PMIC set. No reset-gpios: Sony's overlay has
none; the GCC_UFS_PHY_BCR reset in sm6350.dtsi sufficed in the March 2026
Mobian port.

LOCAL ONLY - do not upstream (pmOS AI policy).
---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6350-sony-xperia-lena-pdx213.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm6350-sony-xperia-lena-pdx213.dts
@@ -856,6 +856,22 @@
 	};
 };
 
+&ufs_mem_hc {
+	vcc-supply = <&pm6150l_l7>;
+	vcc-max-microamp = <800000>;
+	vccq2-supply = <&pm6350_l12>;
+	vccq2-max-microamp = <800000>;
+
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&ufs_mem_phy {
+	vdda-phy-supply = <&pm6350_l18>;
+	vdda-pll-supply = <&pm6350_l22>;
+
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
 &usb_1 {
 	status = "okay";
 };
